abstract: >-
  Python workflows and audited aggregate outputs for common-domain analysis,
  terrain-persistence scenarios, connected coastal-inundation screening,
  population exposure, vertical-datum and connectivity sensitivity, and
  six-site historical-comparison quality control in the Pearl River Estuary.
